ops":{"className":"life-ad-rail","data-dock-active":"false","style":{"top":"94px"}},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-dock","hidden":true},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored life-ad-space-compact","data-ad-placement":"ad_dock","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Advertisement · Community recommendation"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-ad-dismiss","aria-label":"Close ad"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-x","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 6 6 18"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 6 12 12"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Official Shengcai Youshu logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Advertisement · Community recommendation"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Could what you know become a useful product?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["From ebooks to small tools, explore how members spot needs and turn knowledge into something people can use."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/en/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_dock"},"children":["Explore the community and examples",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 7h10v10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 17 17 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Is it worth dating and getting married?"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"data-ad-dock-host":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Getting to know more people rather than fixating on just one: You can’t predict compatibility before meeting someone"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Stop after a clear refusal — continued pursuit is a public order violation, not “sincerity”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Judging whether someone is interested: focus on actions, not “signals” — who initiates, plans, and follows up"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Whether a relationship is good or not depends mainly on how you feel within it, not on your partner’s attributes"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"To build closeness, have two people take turns answering a series of progressively deeper questions — no script needed"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Long-distance relationships aren’t worse than local ones — the real challenge comes in the first three months after moving in together"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Check registration statistics before listening to elders: what do “marriage rate” and “divorce rate” actually mean?"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Accounting for the health benefits of marriage while adjusting for observational data"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Discussing labor division before marriage helps clarify unpaid work responsibilities"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"First check the default legal rules regarding marriage money and property, then decide whether to make a written agreement"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"When parents pay for a house, they should clearly state whether it’s a loan or a gift at the time of transfer"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Money borrowed by a spouse in a large amount — if you didn’t sign or later acknowledge it, it doesn’t automatically become your debt"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Obtaining a marriage certificate requires only an ID card and a signed declaration — no household register needed, no fees, and issuance is immediate"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/10-14","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Undergoing a premarital medical exam: if a serious illness is present, it must be disclosed before marriage registration"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Calculating the cost of walking away: Divorce by mutual agreement requires a 30-day cooling-off period, while divorce via litigation has strict legal prerequisites"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Make a separate tally for the benefits to your elders when they get married — don’t mix it with your own records"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Treating relationship quality as a health factor: focus on the issue, not the person — avoid insults and sarcasm"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"While both partners are of sound mind, complete power of attorney, designated guardianship, and wills: Legally, you are not close relatives; without these, you will have no signing authority or inheritance rights."]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Don’t marry while hiding your sexual orientation, and don’t treat “marriage of convenience” as an easy shortcut: legally, it is a real marriage, and the only way out is divorce"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/10-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"When a relationship is stuck in endless arguments and silent treatment, couples therapy can help — waiting alone rarely does"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/10"},"children":["Chapter 10"," ·"," ","Is it worth dating and getting married?"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"10-14"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["14"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidence"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Undergoing a premarital medical exam: if a serious illness is present, it must be disclosed before marriage registration"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["If a person has a serious illness and fails to disclose it truthfully before marriage registration, the other spouse may petition a court to annul the marriage. This request must be filed within one year of learning about the condition. Since 2003, a premarital medical exam has no longer been a mandatory prerequisite for obtaining a marriage certificate; participation remains entirely voluntary. Exact costs and availability depend on local policies, but the exam typically requires half a day to complete."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["In most regions, the exam is provided free of charge or at…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The legal consequences of concealing such information are clearly defined. Current marriage registration regul…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Undergoing a premarital medical exam: if a serious illness is present, it must be disclosed before marriage registration"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["In most regions, the exam is provided free of charge or at a reduced cost for eligible individuals; otherwise it costs only a few hundred yuan. The procedure itself takes about half a day."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The legal consequences of concealing such information are clearly defined. Current marriage registration regulations stipulate that “any party with a serious illness must disclose this fact to the other party prior to registration; failure to do so permits the other party to petition a court for annulment under Article 1053 of the Civil Code.” The government also promotes premarital exams as a primary measure for preventing birth defects, aiming to maintain a premarital medical exam rate above 70% and a coverage rate for pre‑conception health checks above 80%. Additional policies encourage locating exam facilities near marriage registration offices and offering integrated services that combine registration, medical screening, and fertility counseling. The Civil Code likewise mandates disclosure of serious illnesses prior to marriage; non‑compliance grants the other spouse the right to seek annulment within one year of becoming aware of the condition."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大 (2020). 民法典（第一千零五十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml"]},"；国务院 (2025). 婚姻登记条例（国令第 804 号，第十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202504/content_7017752.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202504/content_7017752.htm"]},"；国家卫生健康委办公厅 (2023). 出生缺陷防治能力提升计划（2023—2027 年）（国卫办妇幼发〔2023〕9 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202308/content_6900320.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202308/content_6900320.htm"]},"；国家卫生健康委等五部门 (2020). 关于加强婚前保健工作的通知（国卫妇幼函〔2020〕205 号）：「积极倡导各地结合实际推行免费婚前检查」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-05/22/content_5513902.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-05/22/content_5513902.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Since 2003 years ago, premarital health examinations have not been a mandatory step for obtaining a marriage certificate; going for one is voluntary. However, the clause regarding \"failing to truthfully disclose major illnesses\" does indeed grant the other party the right to petition the court to annul the marriage, provided the petition is filed within one year from the date the information was discovered. There is no unified national regulation regarding free premarital exams. The notice issued 2020 years ago by five departments, including the National Health Commission, only stated to \"actively advocate for local implementation of free premarital examinations based on local actual conditions.\" Therefore, whether exams are free and which items are included are determined by each locality; please inquire at the one-stop service window of your local maternal and child health care institution or marriage registration office."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/10-13"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Obtaining a marriage certificate requires only an ID card and a signed declaration — no household register needed, no fees, and issuance is immediate"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/10-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"Calculating the cost of walking away: Divorce by mutual agreement requires a 30-day cooling-off period, while divorce via litigation has strict legal prerequisites"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"t